        {
          "question": "e-4785",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Starting from the equation $\\mathbf{a} \\cdot \\mathbf{b}=0,$ we compute the dot product in terms of $x$ and then solve for $x$ in the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 10\\cdot x+x\\cdot x+0\\cdot 8+5\\cdot 5 & =0 \\\\ 10x+{x}^{2}+25 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}+10x+25 & =0 \\\\ (x+5)^{2} & =0 \\\\ x & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $x=-5.$",
